            <ArticleTitle>Altered gene transcription following brief episodes of coronary occlusions.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>175-83</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study was designed to elucidate whether previously observed enhanced mRNAs were due to accelerated transcription, enhanced mRNA stability or both mechanisms. We employed the nuclear run-on technique on myocardial nuclei and found the transcriptional induction of several genes, especially nuclear protooncogenes, Ca2+ regulating and heat shock protein genes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
